# Mansion World
# Rooms and entities for the mansion Discord server

# ============================================================================
# Zone record type
# ============================================================================
%rec: Zone
%key: Id
%mandatory: Id Name
%allowed: Id Name Description

Id: floor-1
Name: Floor 1
Description: The ground floor of the mansion

Id: outside
Name: Outside
Description: The grounds surrounding the mansion

# ============================================================================
# Room record type
# ============================================================================
%rec: Room
%key: Id
%type: Zone rec Zone
%type: HasVoice bool
%type: IsDefault bool
%mandatory: Id Name Description Zone
%allowed: Id Name Description Zone HasVoice IsDefault

Id: foyer
Name: Foyer
Zone: floor-1
IsDefault: yes
Description: You are standing in a grand entryway
+
+ ahead of you is a closed off staircase, the 2nd floor is off limits
+ to your west is a #sitting-room
+ to your north-west is the #gallery
+ to your east is a #hallway

Id: sitting-room
Name: Sitting Room
Zone: floor-1
Description: A cozy sitting room.
+
+ to your east is the #foyer

Id: hallway
Name: Hallway
Zone: floor-1
Description: A hallway, if this was a counterstrike map people would call this connector
+
+ to your north is the #banquet-hall
+ to your east is the #office
+ to your west is the #foyer
+ at the end of the hall is the #restroom

Id: restroom
Name: Restroom
Zone: floor-1
Description: A public restroom with lavender tile walls and white speckled floor tiles. The fluorescent lights hum overhead.
+
+ The #hallway is back the way you came.

Id: office
Name: Office
Zone: floor-1
HasVoice: yes
Description: An office with a bunch of computer equipment. Lots of paperwork related to working on https://github.com/frizzle-chan/mudd
+
+ Northern door leads to the #lounge
+ Western door exits back out to the #hallway

Id: gallery
Name: Gallery
Zone: floor-1
Description: A long room, walls laden with gilt-framed canvases. Impressive art collection!
+
+ to the west is the #library
+ to the east is the #foyer
+ to the north is the #courtyard

Id: library
Name: Library
Zone: floor-1
Description: You are standing in the library.
+
+ In the northern corner of the room is the entrance to the #screening-room
+ behind you is the #gallery

Id: screening-room
Name: Screening Room
Zone: floor-1
HasVoice: yes
Description: The room is dark, lit only by the projector screen cast on the western wall. You can make out theater seats resembling giant lay-z-boy chairs. The room smells like popcorn. This is a certified kinography lair. Only the finest kinos are screened in this room.
+
+ The only door leads back to the #library

Id: banquet-hall
Name: Banquet Hall
Zone: floor-1
Description: You are standing in a vast tiled banquet hall with several round tableclothed tables each flanked with many chairs. Although the austere appearance reminds you of a wedding reception, you get the sense that pizza night is the most frequent event held here.
+
+ to the east is the #lounge
+ the entrance to the #kitchen is in the far north east corner
+ to the south is the #hallway

Id: kitchen
Name: Kitchen
Zone: floor-1
Description: An industrial looking kitchen. Reminds you of that TV show The Bear. That show was alright I guess.
+
+ On the east side of the room you see a walk-in #freezer and a door to the #store-room
+
+ to the west is the #banquet-hall

Id: freezer
Name: Freezer
Zone: floor-1
Description: You walk into the freezer and shut the door. Wow it's cold in here, I don't know what I expected.
+
+ The #kitchen is on the other side of the freezer door.

Id: store-room
Name: Store Room
Zone: floor-1
Description: A store room with a bunch of dry goods as well as random stuff like extra chairs, trash bags, etc.
+
+ door exits back out to the #kitchen

Id: lounge
Name: Lounge
Zone: floor-1
HasVoice: yes
Description: A dimly lit lounge.
+
+ There is a door on the south side of the room leading to the #office
+ To the west is the #banquet-hall

Id: courtyard
Name: Courtyard
Zone: outside
Description: A sprawling stone courtyard behind the mansion. The air is fresh and you can hear birds singing.
+
+ to the south is the #gallery
+ a dirt path leads east to the #race-track

Id: race-track
Name: Race Track
Zone: outside
HasVoice: yes
Description: A well-maintained oval dirt track with white-railed fences. A wooden grandstand lines one side, and a large tote board displays the day's odds. The smell of hay and leather fills the air.
+
+ the path back to the #courtyard is to the west

# ============================================================================
# Entity record type
# ============================================================================
%rec: Entity
%key: Id
%type: Prototype rec Entity
%type: Container rec Entity
%type: Room rec Room
%type: ContentsVisible bool
%type: Rarity enum none common uncommon rare epic legendary mythic quest
%mandatory: Id Name
%allowed: Id Name Prototype Container Room ContentsVisible DescriptionShort DescriptionLong
%allowed: OnLook OnTouch OnAttack OnUse OnTake OnOpen OnClose OnDrop OnFish
%allowed: Tags Rarity

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Base prototypes (no Room field - these are templates, not instances)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Id: object
Name: object
Rarity: none
DescriptionShort: A {{ e.name }}.
OnLook: {{ e.description_long or e.description_short or "You see nothing special." }}{% if e.contents %}
+
+ {{ e.contents }}{% endif %}
OnTouch: You touch the {{ e.name }}. Nothing happens.
OnAttack: You attack the {{ e.name }}, but it has no effect.
OnUse: You can't use the {{ e.name }}.
OnTake: You can't take the {{ e.name }}.
OnFish: You can't fish here.

Id: furniture
Name: furniture
Prototype: object
DescriptionShort: A {{ e.name }} sits here{% if e.contents %}. On it:
+ {{ e.contents }}{% endif %}

Id: chest
Name: chest
Prototype: object
DescriptionShort: A {{ e.name }} sits here.
OnLook: {{ e.description_long or e.description_short or "You see nothing special." }}
OnUse: {{ effects.set_focus() }}You open the {{ e.name }}.{% if e.contents %} Inside:
+ {{ e.contents }}{% else %} It's empty.{% endif %}
OnOpen: {{ effects.set_focus() }}You open the {{ e.name }}.{% if e.contents %} Inside:
+ {{ e.contents }}{% else %} It's empty.{% endif %}
OnClose: {{ effects.clear_focus() }}You close the {{ e.name }}.

Id: glass_object
Name: Glass Object
Prototype: object
OnAttack: You suppress the intrusive thought to smash the {{ e.name }}

Id: record
Name: record
Prototype: object
OnUse: You pull {{ e.name }} from its sleeve, place it on the turntable, and drop the needle. Music fills the room.
OnTake: You can't take the {{ e.name }}, but you can __play__ it.

Id: item
Name: item
Prototype: object
Rarity: common
OnTake: {{ effects.pickup() }}{{ effects.broadcast(user ~ " picks up " ~ e ~ ".") }}You pick up the {{ e.name }}.
OnDrop: {% if container %}You put the {{ e.name }} into the *{{ container.name }}*.{% else %}You drop the {{ e.name }}.{% endif %}{{ effects.drop() }}{{ effects.broadcast(user ~ " drops " ~ e ~ ".") }}

Id: beverage
Name: beverage
Prototype: item
OnUse: {{ effects.grant_xp("vitality", 100) }}{{ effects.destroy() }}{{ effects.broadcast(user ~ " drinks " ~ e ~ ".") }}You crack open the {{ e.name }} and take a refreshing sip. It restores health.
OnAttack: {{ effects.grant_xp("attack", 25) }}{{ effects.destroy() }}{{ effects.broadcast(user ~ " smashes " ~ e ~ "!") }}You smash the {{ e.name }}. Liquid goes everywhere.
OnTake: {{ effects.pickup() }}{{ effects.broadcast(user ~ " grabs " ~ e ~ ".") }}You grab a {{ e.name }}.

Id: beverage_uncommon
Name: beverage (uncommon)
Prototype: beverage
Rarity: uncommon
OnAttack: {{ effects.grant_xp("attack", 50) }}{{ effects.destroy() }}{{ effects.broadcast(user ~ " chucks " ~ e ~ " at the wall!") }}You chuck the {{ e.name }} at the wall. It pops on impact.

Id: beverage_rare
Name: beverage (rare)
Prototype: beverage
Rarity: rare
OnAttack: {{ effects.grant_xp("attack", 100) }}{{ effects.destroy() }}{{ effects.broadcast(user ~ " smashes " ~ e ~ " on the floor!") }}You smash the {{ e.name }} on the floor. Liquid and glass everywhere. That was a good one, too.

Id: beverage_legendary
Name: beverage (legendary)
Prototype: beverage
Rarity: legendary
OnAttack: {{ effects.grant_xp("attack", 400) }}{{ effects.destroy() }}{{ effects.broadcast(user ~ " smashes " ~ e ~ "! It was really expensive.") }}You smash the {{ e.name }}. The liquid pools on the floor. That was really, really expensive.

Id: wallet
Name: Wallet
Prototype: item
Rarity: none
OnTake: You already have your wallet.
OnDrop: You can't drop your wallet.
OnLook: Your wallet contains **{{ user.balance|money }}**.
OnUse: You whip out your wallet, it has **{{ user.balance|money }}**.
OnOpen: You open up your wallet, inside it has **{{ user.balance|money }}**.

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Currency pickups (grant yen on take, don't go to inventory)
# Used by spawning pools, slot machines, NPC rewards, etc.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Id: loose_coins
Name: loose coins
Prototype: object
Rarity: common
Tags: currency slot_prize desk_drawer_loot foyer_vase_loot sitting_room_cushion_loot
DescriptionShort: a few loose coins
OnLook: A small handful of yen coins. Worth about ¥100.
OnTake: {{ effects.grant_currency(100) }}{{ effects.destroy() }}{{ effects.broadcast("**" ~ user ~ "** pockets " ~ e ~ " (+¥100)") }}You pick up the {{ e.name }}. (+¥100)

Id: bundle_of_bills
Name: bundle of bills
Prototype: object
Rarity: uncommon
Tags: currency slot_prize desk_drawer_loot foyer_vase_loot
DescriptionShort: a bundle of yen notes
OnLook: A bundle of yen notes held together with a paper band. Worth about ¥1,000.
OnTake: {{ effects.grant_currency(1000) }}{{ effects.destroy() }}{{ effects.broadcast("**" ~ user ~ "** pockets " ~ e ~ " (+¥1,000)") }}You pick up the {{ e.name }}. (+¥1,000)

Id: money_clip
Name: money clip
Prototype: object
Rarity: rare
Tags: currency slot_prize foyer_vase_loot
DescriptionShort: a silver money clip stuffed with cash
OnLook: An elegant silver money clip stuffed with neatly folded bills. Worth about ¥5,000.
OnTake: {{ effects.grant_currency(5000) }}{{ effects.destroy() }}{{ effects.broadcast("**" ~ user ~ "** pockets " ~ e ~ " (+¥5,000)") }}You pick up the {{ e.name }}. (+¥5,000)

Id: cash_envelope
Name: cash envelope
Prototype: object
Rarity: epic
Tags: currency slot_prize
DescriptionShort: a thick cash envelope
OnLook: A heavy envelope filled with a substantial stack of bills. Worth about ¥25,000.
OnTake: {{ effects.grant_currency(25000) }}{{ effects.destroy() }}{{ effects.broadcast("**" ~ user ~ "** pockets " ~ e ~ " (+¥25,000)") }}You pick up the {{ e.name }}. (+¥25,000)

Id: briefcase_of_cash
Name: briefcase of cash
Prototype: object
Rarity: legendary
Tags: currency slot_prize
DescriptionShort: a briefcase filled with cash
OnLook: A sleek black briefcase packed with neat stacks of bills. Worth about ¥100,000.
OnTake: {{ effects.grant_currency(100000) }}{{ effects.destroy() }}{{ effects.broadcast("**" ~ user ~ "** pockets " ~ e ~ " (+¥100,000)") }}You pick up the {{ e.name }}. (+¥100,000)

Id: gold_brick
Name: gold brick
Prototype: object
Rarity: mythic
Tags: currency slot_prize
DescriptionShort: a gleaming gold brick
OnLook: A solid gold brick stamped with official mint markings. Worth about ¥500,000.
OnTake: {{ effects.grant_currency(500000) }}{{ effects.destroy() }}{{ effects.broadcast("**" ~ user ~ "** pockets " ~ e ~ " (+¥500,000)") }}You pick up the {{ e.name }}. (+¥500,000)

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generic items (used by spawning pools across multiple locations)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Id: fishing_bait
Name: Fishing Bait
Prototype: item
Tags: fishing_bait restroom_trash_loot
Rarity: common
DescriptionShort: a container of {{ e.name }}
DescriptionLong: A small plastic container of nightcrawlers. They're still wriggling.
OnTouch: You poke the worms. They squirm away from your finger.
OnOpen: You pop open the container and watch the worms writhe around.
OnClose: You snap the lid shut, trapping the worms inside.
OnTake: {{ effects.pickup() }}{{ effects.broadcast(user ~ " grabs " ~ e ~ ".") }}You grab the {{ e.name }}.
OnDrop: {% if container %}You toss the {{ e.name }} into the *{{ container.name }}*.{% else %}You set the {{ e.name }} down.{% endif %}{{ effects.drop() }}{{ effects.broadcast(user ~ " drops " ~ e ~ ".") }}

Id: fishing_pole_basic
Name: Bamboo Fishing Pole
Prototype: item
Tags: fishing_pole kitchen_rack_loot
Rarity: common
DescriptionShort: a rickety {{ e.name }}
DescriptionLong: A simple bamboo fishing pole held together with twine. It's seen better days, but it'll do.
OnTouch: The bamboo flexes slightly under your grip. It smells like river mud.
OnUse: You give the {{ e.name }} a practice cast. Swoosh.
OnFish: Try `/interact fish` near some water.
OnTake: {{ effects.pickup() }}{{ effects.broadcast(user ~ " grabs " ~ e ~ ".") }}You grab the {{ e.name }}.
OnDrop: {% if container %}You lean the {{ e.name }} against the *{{ container.name }}*.{% else %}You set the {{ e.name }} down.{% endif %}{{ effects.drop() }}{{ effects.broadcast(user ~ " puts down " ~ e ~ ".") }}

Id: fishing_pole_carbon
Name: Carbon Fiber Rod
Prototype: item
Tags: fishing_pole slot_prize
Rarity: rare
DescriptionShort: a sleek {{ e.name }}
DescriptionLong: A professional-grade carbon fiber fishing rod with a smooth reel mechanism. Lightweight and responsive. Someone paid good money for this.
OnTouch: The carbon fiber is smooth and impossibly light.
OnUse: You give the {{ e.name }} a test flick. It whips through the air with a satisfying *thwip*.
OnFish: Try `/interact fish` near some water.
OnTake: {{ effects.pickup() }}{{ effects.broadcast("**" ~ user ~ "** picks up " ~ e ~ ". Nice rod!") }}You pick up the {{ e.name }}.
OnDrop: {% if container %}You carefully place the {{ e.name }} in the *{{ container.name }}*.{% else %}You set the {{ e.name }} down carefully.{% endif %}{{ effects.drop() }}{{ effects.broadcast(user ~ " puts down " ~ e ~ ".") }}

Id: fishing_pole_golden
Name: Golden Rod
Prototype: item
Tags: fishing_pole desk_drawer_loot
Rarity: legendary
DescriptionShort: a dazzling {{ e.name }} that radiates wealth
DescriptionLong: An ornate fishing rod plated in 24k gold with a jewel-encrusted reel. It's completely impractical but absolutely magnificent. The kind of thing a billionaire would use to fish from their yacht.
OnTouch: The gold is warm to the touch. You can see your reflection in the polished surface.
OnUse: You give the {{ e.name }} a regal flourish. You feel like royalty.
OnFish: Try `/interact fish` near some water.
OnTake: {{ effects.pickup() }}{{ effects.broadcast("**" ~ user ~ "** picks up " ~ e ~ "! It gleams brilliantly!") }}You claim the {{ e.name }}. It's heavier than you expected.
OnDrop: {% if container %}You place the {{ e.name }} reverently into the *{{ container.name }}*.{% else %}You set the {{ e.name }} down. It glimmers on the ground.{% endif %}{{ effects.drop() }}{{ effects.broadcast("**" ~ user ~ "** parts with " ~ e ~ ".") }}

Id: blade_of_dissonance
Name: Blade of Dissonance
Prototype: item
Tags: restroom_trash_loot slot_prize
Rarity: mythic
DescriptionShort: A big impractical sword
DescriptionLong: A big impractical sword that was once used for good but fell into oopey goopey and now it's evil.
OnTouch: The blade is actually quite dull. It's got oopey goopey all over it.
OnTake: {{ effects.pickup() }}{{ effects.broadcast("**" ~ user ~ "** picks up " ~ e ~ ". That seems like a bad idea.") }}You heft the impractically large {{ e.name }} onto your shoulder. \
You feel you made a grave mistake.
OnDrop: You cannot drop the sword, it's evil. It compels you to keep it in your inventory, taking up a ton of space.

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Fish (dispensed by toilet/urinal fishing)
