Id: restroom_sinks
Name: Row of Sinks
Prototype: furniture
Room: restroom
DescriptionShort: A {{ e.name }} lines the wall beneath a long mirror, with soap and paper towel dispensers mounted above.
DescriptionLong: Four white porcelain sinks with chrome fixtures. Above them stretches a long mirror, and mounted on the wall are soap dispensers and paper towel dispensers.
OnTouch: You run your hand under the faucet. The water is lukewarm.
OnUse: You turn on the faucet and wash your hands. The soap smells vaguely of industrial lavender.
OnFish: {% if e.contents %}{{ effects.dispense() }}{{ effects.broadcast("**" ~ user ~ "** is fishing in the sink...") }}You cast your line into the sink and wait...{% else %}You cast into the sink but nothing is biting.{% endif %}

Id: restroom_urinals
Name: Urinals
Prototype: furniture
Room: restroom
ContentsVisible: no
DescriptionShort: Three {{ e.name }} line the wall, separated by privacy dividers.
DescriptionLong: A row of white porcelain urinals with automatic flush sensors. Blue deodorizer pucks sit in the drains. Privacy dividers offer a modicum of dignity.
OnTouch: You touch the porcelain. It's cold. Why did you do that?
OnUse: {{ effects.broadcast("**" ~ user ~ "** uses the urinal.") }}You step up to the urinal and do your business. The automatic sensor flushes when you step away. You feel relieved.
OnFish: {% if e.contents %}{{ effects.dispense() }}{{ effects.broadcast("**" ~ user ~ "** is fishing in the urinal...") }}You cast your line into the urinal and wait...{% else %}You cast into the urinal but nothing is biting.{% endif %}

Id: restroom_stalls
