Id: terminal_inbox_welcome
Name: INBOX - Welcome to the Team
Prototype: terminal_document
Room: office
Container: office_terminal
DescriptionLong: ```
+ FROM: frizzle@mudd.local
+ TO: team@mudd.local
+ SUBJECT: Welcome to the Team
+ DATE: 2026-01-03
+ ----------------------------------------
+
+ Hey there!
+
+ Welcome to the MUDD project - a Discord-based Multi-User Dungeon (MUD) text based adventure!
+
+ The source for the bot is available at https://github.com/frizzle-chan/mudd
+
+ There are dev notes scattered around the world that explain how the various systems work.
+
+ Make yourself at home!
+
+ -Frizzle
+ ```

Id: terminal_inbox_bugs
Name: INBOX - RE: The Vase
Prototype: terminal_document
Room: office
Container: office_terminal
DescriptionLong: ```
+ FROM: qa@mudd.local
+ TO: frizzle@mudd.local
+ SUBJECT: RE: The Vase
+ DATE: 2026-01-08
+ ----------------------------------------
+
+ So I smashed the flower vase in the foyer. Again. For testing.
+
+ And I SWEAR there was a White Claw Mango inside it this time?
+
+ Is that... intended? I thought it was supposed to drop roses.
+ The loot tables are getting weird. Also the roses keep coming
+ back. The vase keeps coming back. Everything keeps coming back.
+
+ I'm starting to think the mansion might be haunted.
+
+ Marking this as "works as intended" I guess?
+
+ -QA
+ ```

